Mica Music — SylvaKru USB transport attribution

This module includes and adapts software from the SylvaKru USB-exclusive
implementation.

Audited reference repository:
  https://github.com/huya688zdx/sylvakru.git
Reference snapshot:
  3f2578692499e403d7eddc6fdbe52d1b6a1b2206

The reference fork states that it is based on the original AfalpHy/sylvakru
project. The reference distribution is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, and its LICENSE identifies:

  Copyright 2025-2026 AfalpHy

A copy of that Apache-2.0 license text is retained in this module as LICENSE.
The audited reference snapshot did not contain a separate upstream NOTICE file.

Mica modifications include Media3 integration, transport/session ownership
fencing, stricter fail-closed behavior, libusb stream-service infrastructure,
state-machine integration, device-specific qualified extensions, and other
adaptations documented in README.md and docs/USB_REFERENCE_FUNCTION_AUDIT.md.

Reference-derived files are marked as modified/adapted for Mica where the file
format permits comments. The usb_dac_quirks.json asset is also derived from the
reference device database and has Mica-specific additions; because JSON does
not permit comments, its attribution is recorded here and in README.md.

